  <h1>Midnight Supermarket</h1>
  <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p>Last updated: October 27, 2026</p>

  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how Midnight Supermarket
    handles information when you play the game.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Save-Data Transfer</h2>
  <p>
    The game provides a feature that generates a code to
    transfer or restore game progress on another device.
    Keep your code private and share it only with people
    you trust. The information contained in the code
    depends on the game's implementation.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Local Multiplayer</h2>
  <p>
    The game supports multiplayer for up to four players
    over a local Wi-Fi network. Devices may communicate
    over that network to enable gameplay.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Data Collection and Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>
    The use of local save-transfer and Wi-Fi multiplayer
    features does not by itself mean that personal data
    is sent to a remote server. Any additional data
    collection, advertising, analytics, crash reporting,
    or third-party services used by the published game
    must be described accurately in this policy.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
  <p>
    Keep your device and save-transfer codes secure.
    Avoid sharing codes publicly.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    The developer should disclose any collection of
    children's personal information by the game or its
    third-party services, where applicable.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    This policy may be updated when the game's features
    or data practices change. Updates will be published
    on this page.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions, contact the developer at:
    muhammad.06.ai@gmail.com
  </p>
</main>
